            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "Since this commit is in this repo, this isn't necessary."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "mahalakshmik-1",
                        "email": "mahalakshmik@ami.com",
                        "username": "mahalakshmik-1"
                    },
                    "message": "Updated. I have removed the unnecessary wording from the commit message."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "If this maps to a redfish function, may as well mention it here."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "mahalakshmik-1",
                        "email": "mahalakshmik@ami.com",
                        "username": "mahalakshmik-1"
                    },
                    "message": "The setting is defined as an internal D-Bus logging policy in Settings.interface. yaml, and phosphor-logging consumes it directly in log_manager.cpp to choose between the linear and circular log-capacity behaviors. Therefore, no explicit mapping to a Redfish function/property is present."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "so you're not going to be writing bmcweb code to change that settings property?  will what be the interface to set it?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "mahalakshmik-1",
                        "email": "mahalakshmik@ami.com",
                        "username": "mahalakshmik-1"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for pointing this out. My earlier statement was inaccurate.\nI have now made the Redfish mapping explicit in the interface description and renamed the property to LogRetentionPolicy for clarity.\nMapping documented is:\nLinear -> LogService.OverWritePolicy = NeverOverWrites\nCircular -> LogService.OverWritePolicy = WrapsWhenFull\nI have also updated phosphor-logging to consume the renamed property."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 16,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "remove"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 16,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "mahalakshmik-1",
                        "email": "mahalakshmik@ami.com",
                        "username": "mahalakshmik-1"
                    },
                    "message": "Done, Removed as requested."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Logging/Settings.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "RetentionPolicy?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Logging/Settings.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "mahalakshmik-1",
                        "email": "mahalakshmik@ami.com",
                        "username": "mahalakshmik-1"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. Renamed the enum from Policy to RetentionPolicy and updated the property type reference accordingly."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Logging/Settings.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 20,
